(* (C struct name, structure_type) for every non-alias struct module --
   DESIGN.md §7/§12/§13's regression check that a generated struct with
   an sType member never silently falls back to StructureType.of_int 0
   (e.g. because its enum value was only reachable from a vulkansc-only
   or disabled extension); VkApplicationInfo is the one legitimate
   structure whose real value is 0. VkBaseInStructure/VkBaseOutStructure
   are the only structs with an sType member and `structure_type = None`:
   the registry deliberately gives them no fixed sType (generic pNext-chain
   link types), so they are absent from this list by construction. *)
